# Store submit credentials (never commit)
google-service-account.json

# Firebase service-account private keys (FCM V1). REAL SECRETS — these grant
# admin access to the Firebase project. They belong in `eas credentials`, never
# in git, and this repo is PUBLIC.
# (`google-services.json` is NOT secret and IS committed — it ships inside the
#  APK anyway. See docs/PUSH_SETUP.md.)
*firebase-adminsdk*.json
*-service-account*.json
